   "mechanism": "Schizophrenia-associated variation at the C4A/C4B locus, with the strongest mechanistic literature implicating C4A, is proposed to increase complement tagging of vulnerable cortical synapses. Microglial C1QA and CX3CR1-dependent state control then promote or tune engulfment, causing excessive adolescent synapse loss and circuit dysfunction; C4B may contribute but locus linkage and the shared mouse orthologue make its independent effect uncertain.",
